              first component library with just 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">12 components</span>.
            </p>

            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
              The first year was slow. We gained 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">200 users</span> through
              word of mouth and relentless community engagement on Twitter and GitHub. We shipped a
              new component every week, learning from every piece of feedback.
            </p>

            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
              By <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">2022</span>, things accelerated. We
              crossed 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">2,500 users</span> and
              raised our seed round of 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">$2.1M</span>. The team
              grew to <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">8 people</span>,
              and we expanded the library to 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">85 components</span>.
            </p>

            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
              <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">2023</span> was our breakout year. We
              launched our Pro tier and grew to 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">18,000 users</span>, with 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">1,200+</span> paying
              customers. Revenue hit 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">$1.2M ARR</span>. The
              component library reached 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">200+ components</span>,
              and we added 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">35 hooks</span> and 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">20 templates</span>.
            </p>

            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
              In <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">2024</span>, we closed our Series A
