              the team to 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">32 people</span> across 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">12 countries</span>. We
              crossed 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">45,000 users</span> and 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">$3.8M ARR</span>.
            </p>

            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Today, we serve over 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">75,000 developers</span> 
              across 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">140+ countries</span>.
              Our library has grown to 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">500+ components</span>, 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">50+ hooks</span>, and 
              <span class="font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">75+ templates</span>. Our
